actor "System" as Actor
participant "Matching Calculation" as Page
participant "Matching Service" as Service
participant "posts" as Table <<entity>>

Actor -> Page: 1: scoreMatchCandidates(source, candidates, config)
activate Page
Page -> Service: 2: Run task with current eligible context
activate Service
Service -> Table: 3: Load active source and bounded opposite candidates
activate Table
Table --> Service: 4: Normalized post and safe image/OCR signals
deactivate Table
Service -> Service: 5: Sanitize configuration; exclude same-owner LOST pairs
Service -> Service: 6: Calculate TF-IDF text, category, location, time, image/OCR\ncomponents
Service -> Service: 7: Weight components; assign tier and safe explainable reasons
Service --> Page: 8: Scored candidate list
Page --> Actor: 9: Record task outcome
deactivate Service
deactivate Page

